    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #376\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPush succeeded to branch `bb/relay-238-generic-rest-01-09-establish-the-sempr-thr_5eaxjabx4q` (`f80ba37..c20bc7d`).\n\n## Summary\n\nPushed the review-fix commit for issue #238 to the existing branch `bb/relay-238-generic-rest-01-09-establish-the-sempr-thr_5eaxjabx4q`. The remote had moved ahead with a merge of `develop` in the meantime, so I merged that into the local branch (no conflicts) before pushing, and re-ran the full pipeline afterward to confirm nothing regressed.\n\n**Changes since the last push, addressing PR #376's review findings:**\n- Added `docs/adr/2026-09-11-additive-only-rest-contract-no-url-versioning.md`, recording the no-URL-versioning / additive-only contract-evolution decision that `adapterRoute.ts`'s JSDoc already asserted (medium finding — missing ADR).\n- Added a test case for the previously-untested 413 `payload_too_large` branch in `adapterRoute.test.ts` (medium finding — untested error path).\n- Tightened `isVersionConflictDetails` in `errorContract.ts` to validate `current`'s required `ItemRow` fields instead of just the presence of a `current` key (low finding).\n- Made `requireAuthenticatedIdentity`, `readJsonBody`, `sendErrorResponse`, `sendItemResponse` module-private in `adapterRoute.ts`, since `createAdapterRequestListener` is the only supported entry point and nothing else called them (low finding).\n\n**Verification:** `pnpm run verify` in `backend/` — 83 test files, 932 tests, exit code 0, after merging in `develop`'s intervening changes.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
